6. Choose the 'Tab' delimiter for your fields, and check the box indicating the first row contains Field 
Names. Select 'Next'; 

7. Select Next to accept field names as is; 
8. Decide on a primary key option (this decision may change depending on use), select 'Next'; 
9. Give the table a name and select 'Finish'.


